            "Reverent respect and loving obedience",
            "Literal fear of God",
            "Doubt about His love",
            "Fear of being punished"
          ],
          "answer": "Reverent respect and loving obedience",
          "reference": "Proverbs 1:7",
          "explanation": "The fear of the LORD is reverence with love, acknowledging His authority and goodness."
        },
        {
          "id": "salmos-u3-l1-e4",
          "kind": "buildVerse",
          "prompt": "Build the verse",
          "text": "The foundation of wisdom",
          "tokens": [
